[
{
  type: install
  message: <<EOM
The Epithet services are disabled by default. Configure
/usr/local/etc/epithet/server.yaml, install the referenced policy and inventory
files, and generate the CA key before enabling a service.

The service account must be able to read the private key. One suitable setup is:

  chown root:epithet /usr/local/etc/epithet/ca.key
  chmod 0640 /usr/local/etc/epithet/ca.key

Use epithet_server for the combined process, or enable both epithet_policy and
epithet_ca for split operation. Do not enable the combined and split modes at
the same time.
EOM
}
{
  type: upgrade
  maximum_version: "0.23.1_1"
  message: <<EOM
This upgrade adds disabled-by-default epithet_server, epithet_ca, and
epithet_policy rc.d services. Configure /usr/local/etc/epithet/server.yaml
before enabling either the combined service or both split services.
EOM
}
{
